  onChanged: (v) => setState(() => _terms = v ?? false),\"\"\",\"\"\"              onChanged: (v) {\n                setState(() => _terms = v ?? false);\n                if (_terms) Analytics.capture('terms_accepted');\n              },\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"                  ? () => Navigator.of(context).pushNamed('/offers')\"\"\",\"\"\"                  ? () {\n                      Analytics.capture('registration_continue_tapped', {\n                        'amount': _amount.round(),\n                        'terms': _terms,\n                      });\n                      Navigator.of(context).pushNamed('/offers');\n                    }\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='lib/screens/offer_screen.dart'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"import 'package:flutter/material.dart';\\n\",\"import 'package:flutter/material.dart';\\n\\nimport '../analytics.dart';\\n\",1)\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"      body: ListView.builder(\"\"\",\"\"\"      // Fire when a scroll settles, not on every pixel (PostHog free tier).\n      body: NotificationListener<ScrollEndNotification>(\n        onNotification: (n) {\n          Analytics.capture('offers_scrolled', {'offset': n.metrics.pixels});\n          return false;\n        },\n        child: ListView.builder(\"\"\")\ns=s.replace(\"\"\"        },\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\"\"\",\"\"\"        },\n        ),\n      ),\n    );\n  }\n}\"\"\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nE\nwhich dart flutter; dart format lib 2>&1|tail -3; git diff --stat\ncat > ANSWER.md <<'E'\n# Analytics events\n\nAdded all six events from `docs/EVENTS.md`, sent through `Analytics.capture`.\n\n**`registration_screen.dart`**\n- `registration_email_started` / `registration_phone_started`: fire once per screen visit, on the first non-empty change of each field. No values are sent (no PII).\n- `loan_amount_changed` (`amount`): fires from the slider's `onChangeEnd`, once per gesture, not on every drag tick.\n- `terms_accepted`: fires only when the box is ticked, not when it is untick